WEBVTT

00:00.033 --> 00:29.933
Black Queen

00:00.533 --> 00:02.040
A female Black Jack makes her appearance.

00:02.293 --> 00:04.607
She's beautiful, cold-hearted, and a queen of the scalpel.

00:04.713 --> 00:06.813
People call her "Black Queen".

00:07.233 --> 00:08.466
We have a seriously injured patient!

00:08.653 --> 00:10.626
All right, prepare for an amputation.

00:10.700 --> 00:13.567
He was planning to go abroad
to play soccer!

00:13.633 --> 00:15.934
The decision is best made quickly.

00:16.101 --> 00:18.301
His mother was very sad about it.

00:18.394 --> 00:19.399
Will you marry me?

00:19.559 --> 00:20.472
It's suspicious.

00:21.546 --> 00:24.077
You want me to choose
between you and my job?

00:24.387 --> 00:25.854
Do you want your boyfriend to die?!

00:26.307 --> 00:29.829
Black Jack, Today's Karte - Black Queen.

00:29.995 --> 00:36.618
I'm going to fly to where you are.

00:29.995 --> 00:36.618
kimi no moto e tonde yuku yo

00:36.953 --> 00:43.959
I know I can spread my wings when I want to see you.

00:36.953 --> 00:43.959
aitai toki tsubasa hiraku

00:44.544 --> 00:47.629
Nobody knows

00:44.544 --> 00:47.629
dara nimo wakaranai

00:48.048 --> 00:51.467
when a miracle might occur,

00:48.048 --> 00:51.467
kiseki wa itsu okiru?

00:51.468 --> 00:57.890
but it feels like my wish is finally coming true.

00:51.468 --> 00:57.890
nozomi wa kanaeraresou de

00:57.891 --> 01:04.688
Because there's only one place I want to go,

00:57.891 --> 01:04.688
mukau basho wa hitotsu shika nai kara

01:04.689 --> 01:07.941
iro asenai omoi yosete

01:04.689 --> 01:07.941
I gather my feelings whose colors never fade,

01:07.942 --> 01:11.487
and now it seems I'm dreaming.

01:07.942 --> 01:11.487
saa Dreaming now

01:12.072 --> 01:15.407
I'm living for your sake?

01:12.072 --> 01:15.407
kimi no tame ni iketeru

01:15.408 --> 01:18.577
I will be your strength,

01:15.408 --> 01:18.577
donna chikara nimo naru

01:18.870 --> 01:21.789
no matter how far apart we are.

01:18.870 --> 01:21.789
Far away Far away harukana

01:21.790 --> 01:25.584
So Freedom. So Freedom.

01:25.710 --> 01:29.171
I will send you

01:25.710 --> 01:29.171
kimi no tame no okurou

01:29.172 --> 01:32.424
the beautiful blossom of this flower.

01:29.172 --> 01:32.424
kirei ni saita hana wo

01:32.592 --> 01:35.511
So let's look for shooting stars.

01:32.592 --> 01:35.511
Shooting Star Shooting Star sagasou

01:35.512 --> 01:39.515
So Freedom. So Freedom.

02:08.254 --> 02:11.004
She's so pretty.

02:11.005 --> 02:12.774
Is she a model? Or an actress?

02:13.716 --> 02:15.884
But I've never seen that face.

02:19.613 --> 02:21.788
Hey, she's walking into a hospital.

02:22.612 --> 02:24.028
What? Critically injured?

02:24.322 --> 02:25.155
A traffic accident?

02:25.156 --> 02:26.906
Bruised throughout the body? And unconscious?

02:27.325 --> 02:28.415
Yes, sir!

02:34.832 --> 02:35.958
Is there a surgeon?!

02:36.145 --> 02:37.937
Is Dr. Kuwata from surgical around?!

02:40.191 --> 02:43.568
Dr. Kuwata, we have a seriously injured
patient from a traffic accident!

02:44.236 --> 02:45.923
All right, I'll.be right there.

02:46.113 --> 02:47.780
It's from a traffic accident.

02:47.781 --> 02:49.866
He's bruised throughout his body and is unconscious.

02:49.867 --> 02:52.827
Blood pressure is at 80/50. Heart rate is 110.

02:52.828 --> 02:55.171
The knee joint is shattered.

02:55.539 --> 02:57.003
Reconstruction is not possible.

02:57.499 --> 03:00.001
Prepare for an amputation low on the femur.

03:00.002 --> 03:00.553
Yes.

03:09.762 --> 03:12.875
Black Queen

03:09.775 --> 03:12.875
Originally "Black Queen” by Tezuka Osamu

03:12.922 --> 03:14.162
In Progress

03:15.226 --> 03:16.601
The femur is exposed.

03:16.602 --> 03:18.061
Set the tissue clamp.

03:19.655 --> 03:20.288
Saw.

03:20.444 --> 03:21.026
Here.

03:27.112 --> 03:30.741
We amputated the leg to save his life.

03:31.700 --> 03:32.728
His leg?

03:35.037 --> 03:38.248
He was planning to go abroad to play soccer!

03:38.707 --> 03:41.668
It has been his dream ever since he was small!

03:41.669 --> 03:43.112
Don't feel so bad.

03:43.295 --> 03:44.810
He is still alive.

03:44.964 --> 03:48.341
He can return to a normal life after rehabilitation.

03:51.845 --> 03:54.764
That patient was still young.

03:55.266 --> 03:58.914
Our first priority is to save lives.

04:01.021 --> 04:03.345
His mother was very sad about it.

04:03.961 --> 04:06.819
Since the answer is still the same no matter
how many times we think about it,

04:07.194 --> 04:09.682
the decision is best made quickly.

04:10.352 --> 04:11.174
Isn't that true?

04:11.491 --> 04:14.575
That is absolutely right.

04:14.576 --> 04:17.120
And for as long I've known you, you've always been right,

04:17.121 --> 04:18.121
but...

04:18.283 --> 04:22.205
Of course, since I'm dealing with people's lives here.

04:23.085 --> 04:25.837
Dr. Kuwata's surgery was quick again today.

04:25.838 --> 04:28.006
Not just fast, but very accurate too.

04:28.007 --> 04:32.719
But still, she scared me when she tossed
the amputated leg like a daikon radish.

04:32.720 --> 04:34.595
She is pretty,

04:34.596 --> 04:35.847
but I'd never go out with her.

04:36.098 --> 04:38.683
Don't worry, you have no chance anyway.

04:38.855 --> 04:41.311
"Surgical Demon" is the perfect name for her.

04:41.312 --> 04:44.314
She saws legs off without flinching.

04:44.815 --> 04:46.649
You think she has a boyfriend?

04:46.650 --> 04:47.817
Who knows?

04:47.818 --> 04:51.846
I can't ever imagine the female
Black Jack having a boyfriend.

04:53.949 --> 04:56.951
Did she just say female Black Jack?

04:56.952 --> 04:59.245
There is someone like that at this hospital?

04:59.997 --> 05:01.164
It's none of our concern.

05:01.165 --> 05:02.017
Let's go.

05:06.628 --> 05:08.338
It bothers me.

05:09.381 --> 05:11.382
Wait, Doc!

05:23.240 --> 05:24.143
Did you wait long?

05:26.191 --> 05:26.651
Hey.

05:27.941 --> 05:29.182
I missed you so much.

05:29.443 --> 05:31.459
We just saw each other the other day.

05:31.695 --> 05:33.668
I want to see you every day.

05:37.659 --> 05:38.910
What's this?

05:39.787 --> 05:40.723
Open it.

05:44.666 --> 05:45.458
It's beautiful!

05:46.502 --> 05:48.169
How wonderful.

05:48.921 --> 05:49.962
But is this...

05:50.631 --> 05:51.756
You mean...

05:52.925 --> 05:53.997
Will you marry me?

05:57.318 --> 05:58.365
Or does this bother you?

05:58.668 --> 06:01.201
Not at all!

06:01.621 --> 06:02.934
I'm so happy.

06:03.852 --> 06:05.520
It's so beautiful.

06:06.688 --> 06:08.611
It is nothing compared to you.

06:08.941 --> 06:10.900
Let's drink to our future.

06:18.450 --> 06:20.087
You're still busy every day?

06:20.619 --> 06:21.869
Performing surgeries?

06:21.870 --> 06:22.662
Yes.

06:23.122 --> 06:28.626
You know, I can't imagine eating dinner so
soon after chopping off arms and legs.

06:29.128 --> 06:31.045
Don't talk about it like that.

06:32.506 --> 06:35.274
Sorry, I didn't mean it like that.

06:36.677 --> 06:37.776
The thing is...

06:38.137 --> 06:40.679
I didn't want to say this today...

06:43.517 --> 06:45.268
Actually, it's not important.

06:45.337 --> 06:46.064
What is it?

06:46.094 --> 06:46.955
Now you made me curious.

06:46.979 --> 06:48.604
Finish what you just started.

06:52.493 --> 06:54.283
I hope you won't be offended by this.

06:54.987 --> 06:59.240
When I came to visit you at the hospital the
other day, I heard rumors about you.

07:00.451 --> 07:01.233
Like what?

07:02.369 --> 07:04.247
They weren't good ones.

07:05.622 --> 07:07.844
Like, you are a cold-hearted queen of scalpels.

07:09.668 --> 07:10.835
Why let them bother you?

07:10.836 --> 07:12.074
Leave them be.

07:14.423 --> 07:16.507
I've heard worse.

07:18.635 --> 07:20.156
The female Black Jack...

07:21.054 --> 07:22.676
You're the Black Queen.

07:26.435 --> 07:30.136
I guess there's a devilish surgeon known as Black Jack.

07:35.194 --> 07:38.696
And you're being compared to such a man!

07:38.697 --> 07:39.614
It's disgraceful!

07:42.075 --> 07:47.830
After we get married, would you stop the
surgeries since I'll be earning money?

07:48.373 --> 07:52.210
You want me to quit being a doctor?

07:52.669 --> 07:55.648
No, all I ask is that you stop performing surgeries.

07:56.048 --> 07:57.715
You could switch to internal medicine.

07:57.716 --> 08:03.149
Rokurou, are you telling me to choose
between you and my job?

08:09.348 --> 08:13.648
If I must choose between you and my job, I'll take my job.

08:14.316 --> 08:15.358
Konomi!

08:16.902 --> 08:18.319
I'm leaving. Good bye.

08:19.238 --> 08:20.738
Konomi! Wait!

08:26.411 --> 08:27.691
Gimme another one.

08:29.112 --> 08:31.160
Yes.

08:36.156 --> 08:38.070
Female Black Jack?

08:40.425 --> 08:44.470
That's right! I'm that kind of doctor!

08:45.138 --> 08:49.392
I'll chop them off left and right!

08:52.145 --> 08:54.652
See, I'm Black Queen.

08:54.898 --> 08:56.607
The female Black Jack.

08:56.608 --> 08:57.358
You get it?

08:57.663 --> 09:00.987
Dr. Black Jack is one of our regulars.

09:02.868 --> 09:04.198
He's right over there.

09:10.956 --> 09:12.923
That's him?

09:14.126 --> 09:15.508
Excuse me!

09:19.172 --> 09:21.215
So you're Dr. Black Jack?

09:21.216 --> 09:22.466
Pleasure to meet you.

09:22.467 --> 09:26.012
I'm Kuwata Konomi.

09:26.013 --> 09:28.896
I've picked up your name as my nick name.

09:29.141 --> 09:29.974
What do you think?

09:29.975 --> 09:30.850
What an honor, huh?

09:33.942 --> 09:37.481
You're a cold-hearted demon of scalpels;

09:37.482 --> 09:41.872
like a vampire; like Dr. Frankenstein;
like a robot; like an ice person!

09:42.154 --> 09:42.993
Are you?

09:44.239 --> 09:46.550
Yes, perhaps.

09:48.744 --> 09:50.911
That's funny!

09:50.912 --> 09:52.747
Just like me.

09:55.208 --> 09:56.709
Let's shake hands.

09:56.883 --> 09:58.919
We're very similar.

09:59.129 --> 10:01.921
Forget it. Why are you so drunk?

10:02.132 --> 10:03.841
Did you make a mistake during a procedure?

10:04.928 --> 10:06.552
Are you kidding me?

10:06.553 --> 10:09.579
I've never ever made a mistake!

10:10.349 --> 10:12.141
Stop picking on me!

10:12.893 --> 10:15.144
Then why are you so upset?

10:15.562 --> 10:16.687
Upset?

10:16.688 --> 10:18.582
Who? Me?

10:19.399 --> 10:20.858
Yeah, right.

10:20.859 --> 10:23.611
I'm as cool as always.

10:23.612 --> 10:25.571
I'm the Queen of Scalpels!

10:26.156 --> 10:29.498
Seriously, you should go home and rest.

10:30.077 --> 10:32.078
Otherwise, you'll have a hangover tomorrow.

10:32.746 --> 10:35.751
No need to tell me. I was about to go.

10:37.209 --> 10:38.501
Bye-bye.

10:39.795 --> 10:42.546
I wonder where she works.

10:42.547 --> 10:43.515
Who knows?

10:44.315 --> 10:44.923
Oh?

10:45.217 --> 10:46.611
What's this?

10:48.178 --> 10:50.429
It's that drunk doctor's.

10:50.430 --> 10:51.483
Is she a regular here?

10:51.932 --> 10:54.792
No, it was her first time here.

10:55.018 --> 10:56.435
Oh dear...

10:56.436 --> 10:59.155
This looks very expensive.

10:59.731 --> 11:00.595
Oh boy.

11:03.443 --> 11:06.045
Welcome home, Doc!

11:07.322 --> 11:09.740
Sniff, sniff...

11:10.951 --> 11:13.664
I smell it.

11:13.829 --> 11:15.257
What is this?

11:20.001 --> 11:21.961
You reek of perfume.

11:23.964 --> 11:25.086
It must just be you.

11:26.842 --> 11:28.509
You think so?

11:28.708 --> 11:33.639
Anyway, Pinoco, do you remember the
rumor about a female Black Jack?

11:33.640 --> 11:35.474
Do you remember which hospital that was?

11:35.809 --> 11:37.017
Oh, that?

11:37.018 --> 11:40.463
It was at Kaisei Hospital in the next town.

11:40.772 --> 11:43.441
Why are you asking that?

11:43.942 --> 11:46.660
I think I picked up something of hers.

11:46.945 --> 11:48.446
The hospital in the next town, huh?

11:48.447 --> 11:49.405
Thanks.

11:49.552 --> 11:51.031
It's suspicious.

11:52.117 --> 11:56.370
Did you pick up  a ring that a drunk woman left at a bar?

12:19.227 --> 12:20.427
Rokurou,

12:21.021 --> 12:25.983
this is your fault because you don't understand how I feel.

12:30.533 --> 12:31.303
Where's the ring?

12:32.073 --> 12:33.574
The engagement ring is gone!

12:34.284 --> 12:37.453
I must have left it somewhere when I was drunk.

12:38.455 --> 12:39.547
What should I do?

12:40.957 --> 12:43.125
Dr. Kuwata, it's time for the operation.

12:45.796 --> 12:47.984
Yes, I'll be right down.

12:48.799 --> 12:53.177
Hey, I heard Dr. Black Queen actually has a boyfriend!

12:53.178 --> 12:54.845
Seriously?

12:54.846 --> 12:55.898
I didn't see that coming.

12:56.765 --> 13:00.516
But I bet it won't go well.

13:00.811 --> 13:02.061
That's true.

13:02.306 --> 13:07.274
I bet the man will run away after getting
tired of her cold-heartedness.

13:08.959 --> 13:12.696
Still, she has impeccable surgical skills.

13:12.697 --> 13:15.199
I still don't want her as my girlfriend.

13:15.951 --> 13:17.180
Commencing the operation.

13:17.577 --> 13:19.620
We will amputate three fingers from his right hand.

13:20.872 --> 13:22.289
Is there a problem?

13:22.290 --> 13:23.611
That's his dominant hand.

13:24.251 --> 13:25.939
I'd leave them on if I could,

13:26.211 --> 13:28.629
but the result is the same no matter
how many times we think about it.

13:28.630 --> 13:29.755
We can't waste time.

13:30.590 --> 13:31.519
True.

13:34.928 --> 13:36.887
Doctor, we have an emergency call!

13:37.077 --> 13:38.042
We're in the middle of a procedure here.

13:38.348 --> 13:40.267
Yes, but it's urgent.

13:40.934 --> 13:42.059
Hello?

13:43.520 --> 13:46.689
What?! Rokurou has a serious injury?!

13:46.690 --> 13:49.400
He was crushed by a crane at the construction site.

13:52.216 --> 13:55.696
H-Hurry him to my hospital!

14:08.128 --> 14:08.958
Rokurou!

14:11.655 --> 14:12.298
Hurry!

14:12.299 --> 14:13.655
I'll handle this patient!

14:17.883 --> 14:21.660
Not only are the bones shattered, but the arteries,
veins, and nerves are damaged too.

14:21.892 --> 14:24.032
There is a chance of an embolism as well.

14:26.646 --> 14:28.230
Oh, God!

14:28.815 --> 14:30.316
Reconstruction is impossible.

14:30.317 --> 14:33.958
We have to amputate.

14:36.388 --> 14:37.133
Right.

14:37.509 --> 14:40.451
Doctor, we must treat him right now.

14:40.452 --> 14:41.223
No...

14:43.011 --> 14:43.913
No!

14:43.914 --> 14:45.748
No, we can't! No way!

14:45.749 --> 14:47.569
We can't cut him!

14:48.251 --> 14:51.495
Doctor! The patient's life is in danger!

14:53.298 --> 14:54.548
It's her boyfriend.

14:54.549 --> 14:56.460
He is?

14:56.676 --> 14:59.307
Do you think she'll chop her boyfriend's leg off too?

14:59.596 --> 15:01.388
Do you think she'll do it?

15:01.389 --> 15:02.806
I bet she will.

15:02.807 --> 15:05.559
If she does, she's truly the devil of scalpels.

15:16.237 --> 15:18.489
Stop! Help!

15:21.576 --> 15:23.036
I can't!

15:24.746 --> 15:27.206
I can't cut him.

15:28.124 --> 15:29.400
What can I do?

15:37.175 --> 15:40.057
Does a female surgeon work for you?

15:45.517 --> 15:47.850
Ohmigewdness!

15:48.228 --> 15:51.016
My hunch was right!

15:51.606 --> 15:55.054
Doc really is taking her this ring!

15:55.318 --> 15:57.443
Yeah, that's her.

15:57.862 --> 15:59.279
What? She's busy right now?

15:59.280 --> 16:00.376
I see.

16:08.852 --> 16:09.652
What the...

16:09.958 --> 16:13.210
I know what's going on!

16:13.411 --> 16:15.299
What is it?

16:16.131 --> 16:22.469
You claim that you're returning what you found to that
Black Queen or whatever pretty woman doctor,

16:22.470 --> 16:25.079
but you're actually going to go see her!

16:26.827 --> 16:29.143
How can you tell that much?

16:29.278 --> 16:32.146
Largo! Keep your eyes on Doc!

16:44.909 --> 16:46.952
It's too quiet.

16:52.042 --> 16:53.564
Only Largo is here!

16:58.381 --> 16:59.173
He tricked me!

17:05.096 --> 17:07.097
Useless dog!

17:15.815 --> 17:18.067
Doctor, please decide.

17:18.283 --> 17:19.086
Hold on.

17:19.402 --> 17:23.102
Please, give me some time.

17:23.449 --> 17:24.008
But...

17:24.261 --> 17:26.950
I know we don't have much time,

17:27.994 --> 17:30.537
but leave me alone for a minute.

17:42.759 --> 17:44.324
You're OK from the hangover?

17:44.636 --> 17:45.879
You are...

17:46.179 --> 17:48.673
You left this.

17:54.145 --> 17:55.142
Is something wrong?

17:55.772 --> 17:57.940
Where's all the energy from last night?

18:00.235 --> 18:02.776
Doctor, can you tell me...

18:06.574 --> 18:12.913
If you had a girlfriend and her life was in danger,

18:13.456 --> 18:17.042
would you amputate her limbs,
be it legs or arms, without hesitation?

18:17.043 --> 18:18.019
I would.

18:19.295 --> 18:22.840
Even if you cherish your girlfriend's
body more than your own life?

18:23.117 --> 18:24.766
I'm a doctor.

18:25.135 --> 18:28.703
When a doctor makes a diagnosis, what difference does
it make between a girlfriend's body and a squid's head?

18:29.305 --> 18:30.332
Right.

18:31.349 --> 18:33.642
You really are cold-hearted.

18:39.107 --> 18:40.542
So it's your...

18:44.070 --> 18:45.303
Is he in serious condition?

18:52.537 --> 18:54.775
Then go and perform the surgery!

18:54.914 --> 18:56.220
Go chop him up!

18:56.624 --> 18:57.603
Don't hesitate!

19:01.921 --> 19:04.756
Looks like I walked into a serious situation.

19:16.561 --> 19:18.029
Dr. Kuwata,

19:18.133 --> 19:19.173
we need to...

19:19.981 --> 19:21.106
I know.

19:21.608 --> 19:23.110
We're racing against time,

19:23.401 --> 19:23.942
but...

19:23.943 --> 19:29.661
Do you want your boyfriend to die while you're here?

19:30.078 --> 19:31.410
No! No!

19:32.994 --> 19:34.244
No, I don't...

19:34.461 --> 19:35.805
Get ready for the operation.

19:39.876 --> 19:41.089
I'll help you,

19:41.461 --> 19:42.327
so do it!

19:53.890 --> 19:56.341
Commencing the operation.

19:56.851 --> 19:59.522
We will cut at the lower femur.

19:59.999 --> 20:00.375
Scalpel.

20:20.541 --> 20:21.375
What's wrong?

20:23.741 --> 20:25.226
I can't!

20:25.463 --> 20:27.005
I can't do this!

20:29.342 --> 20:30.330
Fine.

20:33.072 --> 20:34.930
I'll do it for her.

20:36.182 --> 20:37.268
We will cut open the injured section.

20:37.725 --> 20:39.601
After reconstructing the bones,

20:39.602 --> 20:41.126
we will reconnect the nerves,

20:41.396 --> 20:42.604
torn tendons, and muscles.

20:42.605 --> 20:44.098
torn tendons, and muscles.

20:46.150 --> 20:48.068
You won't amputate?

20:49.529 --> 20:52.239
Amputation is normally the right answer here

20:52.865 --> 20:55.826
because most doctors would cause air embolisms.

21:15.871 --> 21:17.795
You didn't amputate?

21:18.346 --> 21:20.183
This is unbelievable.

21:20.184 --> 21:21.393
It's a miracle.

21:22.729 --> 21:24.234
I didn't do it.

21:24.564 --> 21:25.605
It was him.

21:26.357 --> 21:27.757
You did it.

21:27.984 --> 21:29.568
I only helped you.

21:29.814 --> 21:32.429
It's his birthday today, right?

21:33.031 --> 21:35.574
It's a wonderful present for him.

21:39.203 --> 21:40.156
Rokurou!

21:44.947 --> 21:47.449
Rokurou! I'm so glad!

21:48.671 --> 21:50.714
It's so wonderful!

21:56.637 --> 21:57.775
Good luck with your marriage.

22:11.241 --> 22:12.059
What the heck?

22:12.820 --> 22:13.820
It won't open.

22:13.821 --> 22:14.604
What's going on?

22:14.822 --> 22:16.073
Pinoco?

22:16.074 --> 22:19.714
You left through the window, so you can
come back in through the window.

22:24.015 --> 22:29.127
As you look at the ground uncertainly,

22:24.015 --> 22:29.127
tamerai gachi no fuseta hitomi

22:29.128 --> 22:34.424
I gently pull your hair closer to me.

22:29.128 --> 22:34.424
kono te ga sono kami hikiyoseteta

22:35.055 --> 22:41.556
You didn't speak, but only sighed,

22:35.055 --> 22:41.556
nani mo iezu ni kobore ochita tameiki

22:41.557 --> 22:46.019
and wet my chest with your tears.

22:41.557 --> 22:46.019
namida ga mune wo nurashita

22:46.020 --> 22:51.274
You longed to hear it, even if it was a lie.

22:46.020 --> 22:51.274
use demo ii... to kitto nozonde ita

22:51.275 --> 22:56.029
But I couldn't give you the answer you wanted.

22:51.275 --> 22:56.029
kimi no kimochi ni kotae kirezu

22:56.030 --> 23:04.454
If I gave you that answer, despite my cowardice,

22:56.030 --> 23:04.454
okubyou na boku ga moshi sono toki kotaetetara mada

23:04.455 --> 23:08.041
would we still be together?

23:04.455 --> 23:08.041
tsuzuiteita noka?

23:08.042 --> 23:13.338
That irregular breath my body was accustomed to,

23:08.042 --> 23:13.338
karada ga oboeta fukisoku na breath

23:13.342 --> 23:18.802
I want to feel it one more time.

23:13.342 --> 23:18.802
mou ichido subete de kanjitai

23:18.803 --> 23:24.307
The breath of surprise when I lost everything.

23:18.803 --> 23:24.307
subete wo nakushita fuyoui na breath

23:24.308 --> 23:33.483
And the pain that binds me every time I feel regret.

23:24.308 --> 23:33.483
kuyamu tabi mata sono itami ga shimetsukeru

23:45.079 --> 24:14.953
Encounter of the Couple Who Share a Past

23:45.455 --> 23:46.988
An encounter of love and
missed opportunities.

23:47.618 --> 23:51.339
Lost memories reunite the couple
who once lost each other.

23:51.685 --> 23:55.103
I can't remember my name or anything.

23:55.431 --> 23:56.711
She has amnesia.

23:56.993 --> 24:00.393
I'll take care of you until you
get your memory back.

24:01.999 --> 24:03.435
Where am I?

24:03.731 --> 24:04.731
Come back!

24:04.792 --> 24:06.368
Are you still with Sachi-san?

24:06.580 --> 24:08.514
A man changes in five years.

24:08.628 --> 24:10.864
"Sachi," like happiness.

24:11.023 --> 24:14.665
Black Jack, Next Karte - Encounter of the Couple Who Share a Past.

24:15.943 --> 24:17.614
Karte NG...
